  "bodyHash": "b5c4d4aaba540572",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。充滿愛意打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「花之擬態」是一款為 SpookyJam 2023 製作的模組。它具備高度可設定性。預設情況下，當玩家在夜晚走動時，任何花朵都有可能成為擬態怪並變身為生物。發生這種情況時會降下閃電。該擬態怪將擁有自訂名稱。當玩家擊殺擬態怪時，會掉落額外物品與經驗值。它原來所在的花朵方塊會被放回原位。花朵有 <strong>1/50</strong> 的機率成為擬態怪。<br><br><strong>可能會造成一些驚嚇效果！<span style=\"font-size:18px\">👻</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br><br>雖然預設了經驗值的數值，但可以修改許多行為。例如哪些花朵能變成擬態怪、掉落什麼物品，以及擬態怪出現的時間與方式等各種設定。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的 RPG 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>flowerIsMimicChance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 0.02，最小 0，最大 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">遇到的花朵成為擬態怪並變身為生物的機率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>extraExperienceOnMimicDeath</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 30</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">每次擊殺擬態怪時應掉落的額外經驗值數量。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dropExtraItemsOnMimicDeath</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在擊殺擬態怪時，依照 ./config/flowermimics/.. 中指定的物品進行掉落。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>onlyTransformMimicsAtNight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">花朵是否僅在夜晚才變身為生物。若停用，則隨時可能變身。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>resetMimicsBeforeNightTime</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當白天轉為夜晚時，是否重置擬態花的候選可能性。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">擬態生成時，是否移除其原來所在的花朵方塊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dropFlowerItemOnMimicDeath</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">擬態死亡時是否掉落原花朵的物品。必須啟用 'removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn'。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceOriginalFlowerBlockOnMimicDeath</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">擬態死亡時是否在原位重新放置原始花朵方塊。必須啟用 'removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn'。目標位置必須是空氣方塊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>placeFlowerBlockWhereMimicDies</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在擬態死亡處放置一個花朵方塊。必須啟用 'removeFlowerBlockOnMimicSpawn'。目標位置必須是空氣方塊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showLightningOnMimicSpawn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">擬態生成時是否顯示閃電效果。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showLightningOnFlowerBlockReturn</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">當花朵方塊被重新放置到世界時是否顯示閃電效果。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventMimicsOnPlacedAndBoneMealFlowers</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否防止手動放置和使用骨粉催生的花朵生成擬態怪。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>checkForMimicAroundBlockRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 15，最小 1，最大 30</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模組應在距離玩家多少格範圍內檢查擬態怪。增加此數值會消耗更多運算資源。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mimicTransformAroundPlayerRange</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 5，最小 1，最大 30</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家需接近花朵擬態怪多近才會觸發變身。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>checkForMimicFlowersDelayInTicks</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 50，最小 1，最大 3600000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模組檢查玩家周圍花朵擬態怪的頻率（間隔）。20 ticks = 1 秒</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此外還有兩個設定檔位於 <em><strong>./config/flowermimics/ 目錄中：</strong></em></span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可以設定花朵擬態怪會變為什麼生物。也支援模組新增的生物與花朵：</span></strong><br><em>./config/flowermimics/flower_mimics.txt</em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您可以更改花朵擬態怪掉落哪些物品：</span></strong><br><em>./config/flowermimics/flower_item_drops.txt</em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>夜晚走動時請小心！花朵可能只是別的東西：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>預設情況下，當你擊殺擬態怪時，它會將原始花朵放回原位。擬態怪也會掉落額外物品與經驗值：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/flower-mimics/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系內，您可以自由在任何模組包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。感謝您！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
